**/target/

.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Never bake credentials or pairing state into an image. These patterns have to be "**/"
# rather than bare names: a bare name matches only at the context root, and both files now
# live in ./data, which the next rule keeps out wholesale. Both are here on purpose, so
# moving the data directory cannot quietly re-open the hole.
data/
**/daikin.config.json
**/*.state.json

deploy/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
